    "title": "Manufacturer invests $12M in local facility after relocating - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hailey Roden, Cincinnati Business Courier ,\n10 hours ago CINCINNATI (Cincinnati Business Courier) - The world's largest provider of thermal processing services has invested $12 million following the relocation of its Tri-State facility. Bodycote, headquartered in Macclesfield, England, has relocated its former Lower Price Hill facility at 710 Burns St. to a new 55,000-square-foot site in Fairfield at 8551... Read full article",
